msgstr "FlexDesigner で"

#: ../../source/functions/system_control/audio_mixer.md:11
msgid "![1744987057470](image/audio_mixer/1744987057470.png)"
msgstr "![1744987057470](image/audio_mixer/1744987057470.png)"

